@startuml
title Current Robot Runtime State Machine

[*] --> ContainerStarting

ContainerStarting : Kubernetes starts robot pod on gamma
ContainerStarting : command ./myapp 100 100 true
ContainerStarting --> Configured : main()

Configured : create InfluxDB writer
Configured : parse response_timeout, FPS, debug flag
Configured : initPIDs()
Configured --> WaitingForFrame

WaitingForFrame : spin in animation()
WaitingForFrame --> FrameDue : delta_time > 1/FPS
WaitingForFrame --> ContainerCrash : process exits / segfault

FrameDue : compute delta_time
FrameDue : compute update_delta_time
FrameDue --> ResetRobot : phi and phip are near zero
FrameDue --> BalanceCheck : normal frame

ResetRobot : myBot.initRobot()
ResetRobot --> BalanceCheck

BalanceCheck --> DynamicsAdvanced : abs(phi) <= 0.785
BalanceCheck --> FallenSaturated : phi > 0.785
BalanceCheck --> FallenSaturated : phi < -0.785

DynamicsAdvanced : myBot.dynamics(delta_time, F)
DynamicsAdvanced : update x/z position
DynamicsAdvanced --> SaveCorrectionState

SaveCorrectionState : save PID x, psi, phi
SaveCorrectionState : save rotation and motor forces
SaveCorrectionState --> CorrectionWorkerRunning

state CorrectionWorkerRunning {
  [*] --> RequestX
  RequestX : timedPidUpdate("x")
  RequestX --> RequestPsi : x PID response parsed
  RequestX --> WorkerException : HTTP/JSON error

  RequestPsi : timedPidUpdate("psi")
  RequestPsi --> RequestPhi : psi PID response parsed
  RequestPsi --> WorkerException : HTTP/JSON error

  RequestPhi : tilt = -PID_x + phi
  RequestPhi : timedPidUpdate("phi")
  RequestPhi --> WorkerCompleted : phi PID response parsed
  RequestPhi --> WorkerException : HTTP/JSON error

  WorkerCompleted : update rotation
  WorkerCompleted : update F[0], F[1]
  WorkerCompleted : cv.notify_one()
  WorkerCompleted --> [*]

  WorkerException : log exception
  WorkerException : sleep response_timeout ms
  WorkerException --> [*]
}

CorrectionWorkerRunning --> WaitingForCorrection

WaitingForCorrection : main thread waits on condition_variable
WaitingForCorrection --> PIDApplied : worker notifies before 100 ms
WaitingForCorrection --> TimeoutRecovery : wait_for reaches 100 ms
WaitingForCorrection --> TimeoutRecovery : exception reaches timeoutCorrection()

PIDApplied : keep new PID state
PIDApplied : keep new motor forces
PIDApplied : timeout_happened=false
PIDApplied : update_ref_time=now
PIDApplied --> WriteInflux

TimeoutRecovery : restore saved PID state
TimeoutRecovery : restore rotation and motor forces
TimeoutRecovery : timeout_happened=true
TimeoutRecovery : keep previous update_ref_time
TimeoutRecovery --> WriteInflux

FallenSaturated : set phi to +2.03 or -2.03
FallenSaturated : skip PID correction
FallenSaturated --> WriteInflux

WriteInflux : write measurement angle
WriteInflux : fields value, timeout, delta_time
WriteInflux : tag robotname=pod hostname
WriteInflux : reset timeout_happened=false
WriteInflux --> WaitingForFrame

ContainerCrash : Kubernetes may restart container
ContainerCrash --> ContainerStarting : restart policy

@enduml
